---
const cli = [
  ["ods status", "健康检查 + GPU 状态"],
  ["ods list", "所有服务及其状态"],
  ["ods logs llm", "跟踪日志（别名：llm、stt、tts）"],
  ["ods restart [service]", "重启一个或全部服务"],
  ["ods start / stop", "启动或停止技术栈"],
  ["ods mode cloud", "通过 LiteLLM 切换到云端 API"],
  ["ods mode local / hybrid", "本地推理 / 本地为主、云端兜底"],
  ["ods model swap T3", "切换到不同的硬件层级"],
  ["ods enable n8n", "启用一个扩展"],
  ["ods config show", "查看 .env（密钥已遮蔽）"],
  ["ods preset save / load", "快照并恢复当前配置"],
];
---

<section id="extend" class="relative border-b border-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-350 px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="reveal eyebrow">Extensible</p>
      <h2
        class="reveal mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.2vw,3.4rem)] font-bold leading-[1.15] tracking-tight"
      >
        ODS 的设计，
        <span class="text-amber">就是用来魔改的</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="reveal mt-6 text-[16px] leading-loose text-muted">
        每个服务都是一个扩展——一个带有
        <code class="rounded bg-base-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">manifest.yaml</code>
        与
        <code class="rounded bg-base-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">compose.yaml</code>
        的文件夹。控制台、CLI、健康检查与 compose 技术栈都会自动发现这些扩展。
        安装器本身也是模块化的——41 个库模块、一个共享的服务注册表，以及 14 个有序的阶段文件。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-14">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="panel noise overflow-hidden">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line px-5 py-3.5">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-amber/70"></span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.16em] text-faint">extensions/services/</span>
          </div>
          <pre
            class="overflow-x-auto px-5 py-5 font-mono text-[12.5px] leading-loose text-ink/90"
          >extensions/services/
  my-service/
    manifest.yaml      <span class="text-faint"># 元数据：名称、端口、健康端点、GPU 后端</span>
    compose.yaml       <span class="text-faint"># Docker Compose 片段（自动合并进技术栈）</span>

<span class="text-faint">$ </span>ods enable my-service     <span class="text-faint"># 启用它</span>
<span class="text-faint">$ </span>ods disable my-service    <span class="text-faint"># 禁用它</span>
<span class="text-faint">$ </span>ods list                  <span class="text-faint"># 查看全部</span></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/Osmantic/ODS/blob/main/ods/docs/EXTENSIONS.md"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line px-5 py-3 text-sm text-ink transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-amber/50 hover:text-amber active:scale-[0.98]"
          >
            完整扩展指南
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/Osmantic/ODS/blob/main/ods/docs/INSTALLER-ARCHITECTURE.md"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line px-5 py-3 text-sm text-ink transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-amber/50 hover:text-amber active:scale-[0.98]"
          >
            安装器架构
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal">
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">ods-cli</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.9] text-muted">
          <code class="rounded bg-base-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-amber">ods</code>
          CLI 管理你的整个技术栈：
        </p>
        <dl class="mt-6 divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
          {
            cli.map(([cmd, desc]) => (
              <div class="group grid grid-cols-1 gap-1.5 py-4 transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-base-800/40 sm:grid-cols-[13.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-6">
                <dt class="font-mono text-[12.5px] text-ink transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:text-amber">
                  {cmd}
                </dt>
                <dd class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.8] text-muted">{desc}</dd>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
